Paimon","textMapHash":2169349274,"text":"We did. You're indeed innocent, Antei.","nextNodeIds":[722370503]},{"nodeId":722370503,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20480,"speakerName":"Antei","textMapHash":1857400322,"text":"From how you spoke earlier, you aren't Jibashiri... Which is a shame. You could've declared me innocent on the spot otherwise.","nextNodeIds":[722370504]},{"nodeId":722370504,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20480,"speakerName":"Antei","textMapHash":2237094866,"text":"That would have saved me some time.","nextNodeIds":[722370505]},{"nodeId":722370505,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20480,"speakerName":"Antei","textMapHash":2291208626,"text":"Again, I feel really energized, but I'm quite sure that I was exhausted from losing too much blood just a while ago. I just can't shake the feeling that I'm going to die shortly...","nextNodeIds":[722370506]},{"nodeId":722370506,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3510617218,"text":"Uh...","nextNodeIds":[722370507]},{"nodeId":722370507,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20480,"speakerName":"Antei","textMapHash":517331330,"text":"*sigh* Let me ask you a question, stranger. Does a man sin who has been wrongly convicted by Byakuyakoku?","nextNodeIds":[722370508]},{"nodeId":722370508,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3898291770,"text":"...","nextNodeIds":[722370509]},{"nodeId":722370509,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20480,"speakerName":"Antei","textMapHash":3617766802,"text":"If I, due to my disturbed state of mind, was left here by Tokoyo Ookami as a Sinshade. Is this transgression?","nextNodeIds":[722370510]},{"nodeId":722370510,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20480,"speakerName":"Antei","textMapHash":2245911938,"text":"Am I guilty?","nextNodeIds":[722370511]},{"nodeId":722370511,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2407530434,"text":"No, you aren't.","nextNodeIds":[722370512]},{"nodeId":722370512,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1048190706,"text":"#Be careful {NICKNAME}. If he realizes that... you know, then he's gonna disappear.","nextNodeIds":[722370513]},{"nodeId":722370513,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2570613370,"text":"You're just an afterimage that Antei left behind.","nextNodeIds":[722370514]},{"nodeId":722370514,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20480,"speakerName":"Antei","textMapHash":890418818,"text":"...","nextNodeIds":[722370515]},{"nodeId":722370515,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":13602834,"text":"You are innocent, and I will make sure the world knows that.","nextNodeIds":[722370516]},{"nodeId":722370516,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20480,"speakerName":"Antei","textMapHash":292316386,"text":"Haha. So that's it? So, I'm just a shadow, left behind after my death.","nextNodeIds":[722370517]},{"nodeId":722370517,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20480,"speakerName":"Antei","textMapHash":370748642,"text":"And... I am innocent.","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":722370518,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20480,"speakerName":"Antei","textMapHash":701182306,"text":"Antei's afterimage starts to recite some broken passages—\\n\"What divine law have I broken... Why do the unfortunate rely on the gods?\\nDo my deeds have meaning, now that my earnest deeds have earned me a sinful name?\"","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7223705,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AR